       {
        "type": "bold"
       }
      ],
      "text": "Peds:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " metformin = the MC first-line oral drug < 18 y; monotherapy when initial A1C < 8.5% w.o acidosis or ketosis; ≥ 10 y: start 500 mg PO BID w meals; ↑ by 500 mg wkly to max 2000 mg/day, divided BID."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": -18,
     "spaceBefore": 0,
     "spaceAfter": 0,
     "line": null,
     "align": "left",
     "shade": null,
     "borders": null,
     "marker": {
      "text": "•",
      "font": null,
      "marks": [],
      "tabPt": 18
     }
    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "marks": [
       {
        "type": "bold"
       }
      ],
      "text": "CI:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " eGFR < 30. Don't start @ eGFR 30–45; reassess if eGFR falls below 45. Contraindicated w risk of acidemia (hypoxia, severe resp dz, EToH use dx, met acidosis, dehydration). Withhold for surg, IV contrast and serious illness."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": -18,
     "spaceBefore": 0,
     "spaceAfter": 0,
     "line": null,
     "align": "left",
     "shade": null,
     "borders": null,
     "marker": {
      "text": "•",
      "font": null,
      "marks": [],
      "tabPt": 18
     }
    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "marks": [
       {
        "type": "bold"
       }
      ],
      "text": "Boxed warning:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " lactic acidosis (can be fatal); RF incl renal impairment, carbonic anhydrase inhibitors (eg, topiramate), contrast studies, surg, hypoxic states, excess EToH, hepatic impairment. GI effects (bloating, discomfort, diarrhea) lessen w slow titration or ER form. Rarely → hypoglycemia; wt neutral or modest loss."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": -18,
     "spaceBefore": 0,
     "spaceAfter": 0,
     "line": null,
     "align": "left",
     "shade": null,
     "borders": null,
     "marker": {
      "text": "•",
      "font": null,
      "marks": [],
      "tabPt": 18
     }
    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "eGFR b4 starting and ± yearly. Hematologic parameters yearly and vit B12 Q2-3 years."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": -18,
     "spaceBefore": 0,
     "spaceAfter": 0,
     "line": null,
     "align": "left",
     "shade": null,
     "borders": null,
     "marker": {
      "text": "•",
      "font": null,
      "marks": [],
      "tabPt": 18
     }
    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "marks": [
       {
        "type": "bold"
       }
      ],
      "text": "Sus lactic acidosis:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " stop metformin, supportive care in hsp; prompt hemodialysis."
     }
    ]
   }
